    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our discord server if you are interested in our game.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manifest Destiny is a retro top-down perspective puzzle adventure game with arcade-style fast-paced levels and multi-branch story telling. </h2><br>When a frustrated game developer escapes into his remaining Utopia\u2014the game world, how can he discover the meaning of the existence of virtual characters with the abilities he learned, and the truth behind the fate? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/e5ff628618aa5dcd4f2d8d77abfb4de2.avif?t=1747364387\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><br>As the \u201cCreator\u201d of the game world, the hero owns an unusual combat style. He can use \u201cProgramming\u201d to trigger traps and create chance, use \u201cArt\u201d to rebuild the level and change the landscape, or use \u201cMusic\u201d to control the emotion and thinking of both enemies and friendly characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/ead3fa9971cea82c25cf70f9ac3cf173.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/ead3fa9971cea82c25cf70f9ac3cf173.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/ead3fa9971cea82c25cf70f9ac3cf173.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the same time, this set of abilities is suitable for solving puzzles in the game, and brings new probabilities to level, which all depend on your creativity! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/457d1f5e223d01f825ab655ad868d568.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/457d1f5e223d01f825ab655ad868d568.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/457d1f5e223d01f825ab655ad868d568.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/5ad55e65b417c0e8db3c3bec10de29d7.avif?t=1747364387\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><br>Acting a \u201cGood goodness\u201d to help people with kindness, or being a \u201cdevil incarnate\u201d and living in a world flowed with the rivers of blood?<br>In Manifest Destiny, your words and deeds will be recorded by the \u201cGood and Evil system\u201d. Whether it\u2019s killing people and looting, or helping the elder cross the street, it will have a real impact on the story. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/9fac2d19b0181538581363ae9c72a6fe.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/9fac2d19b0181538581363ae9c72a6fe.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/9fac2d19b0181538581363ae9c72a6fe.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Multiple clear ways are available for all levels of the game. You can kill every living creature you meet, or you can use various ways to pass the level peacefully.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/d4.gif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=342 /></span><br><br>But please note: all choices will come with costs. Sometimes costs can lead you to the commanding heights of destiny, however, sometimes these costs will be too expensive for you to bear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/bff5a1c14576ab03d9f901b8be486237.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/bff5a1c14576ab03d9f901b8be486237.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/bff5a1c14576ab03d9f901b8be486237.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/1d1732c9811c0f366e6174477f95f936.avif?t=1747364387\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><br>How will a kind and brave developer treat the characters in his fictional story when the virtual and real worlds are gradually blurring?<br>When your family, friends and banking accounts are all against you pursuing your teenage dreams, will you do everything you can to change their mind?<br>Or will you bravely discard your past and try to seek redemption in the virtual world?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/f7daed5093166071f36bc7a61f0cb3b1.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/f7daed5093166071f36bc7a61f0cb3b1.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/f7daed5093166071f36bc7a61f0cb3b1.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join our discord server if you are interested in our game.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manifest Destiny is a retro top-down perspective puzzle adventure game with arcade-style fast-paced levels and multi-branch story telling. </h2><br>When a frustrated game developer escapes into his remaining Utopia\u2014the game world, how can he discover the meaning of the existence of virtual characters with the abilities he learned, and the truth behind the fate? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/e5ff628618aa5dcd4f2d8d77abfb4de2.avif?t=1747364387\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><br>As the \u201cCreator\u201d of the game world, the hero owns an unusual combat style. He can use \u201cProgramming\u201d to trigger traps and create chance, use \u201cArt\u201d to rebuild the level and change the landscape, or use \u201cMusic\u201d to control the emotion and thinking of both enemies and friendly characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/ead3fa9971cea82c25cf70f9ac3cf173.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/ead3fa9971cea82c25cf70f9ac3cf173.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/ead3fa9971cea82c25cf70f9ac3cf173.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At the same time, this set of abilities is suitable for solving puzzles in the game, and brings new probabilities to level, which all depend on your creativity! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/457d1f5e223d01f825ab655ad868d568.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/457d1f5e223d01f825ab655ad868d568.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/457d1f5e223d01f825ab655ad868d568.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/5ad55e65b417c0e8db3c3bec10de29d7.avif?t=1747364387\" width=620 height=120 /></span><br><br>Acting a \u201cGood goodness\u201d to help people with kindness, or being a \u201cdevil incarnate\u201d and living in a world flowed with the rivers of blood?<br>In Manifest Destiny, your words and deeds will be recorded by the \u201cGood and Evil system\u201d. Whether it\u2019s killing people and looting, or helping the elder cross the street, it will have a real impact on the story. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/9fac2d19b0181538581363ae9c72a6fe.poster.avif?t=1747364387\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/9fac2d19b0181538581363ae9c72a6fe.webm?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611410/extras/9fac2d19b0181538581363ae9c72a6fe.mp4?t=1747364387\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Multiple clear ways are available for all levels of the game. You can kill every living creature you meet, or you can use various ways to pass the level peacefully.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati